      "content": "the way you put it... it's almost a relief to hear someone actually say it. i've been trying so hard to \"rebuild\" or \"pivot\" like people say, but it feels so fake. like trying to build a house on top of a crater. there's nothing left to build on. what's the point of trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken?",
